  "narrative": {
    "intro": "Valero Marketing and Supply obligated $520M in FY2026 to date across 109 federal awards. Valero Marketing and Supply recorded an average award size of $4.8M. Obligations are down 55.9% year over year compared with the prior fiscal period. Valero Marketing and Supply’s federal obligations peaked in recent years at $1.4B in FY22 and have since moved through $1.2B in FY23, $1.1B in FY24, and $1.2B in FY25 before arriving at $520M in FY26. Valero Marketing and Supply’s FY21 total was $513M. The current-year totals are partial and reflect fiscal year to date obligations rather than full-year totals. Contract counts and award-size figures show relatively large, concentrated awards, and the year-over-year decline indicates materially lower obligations in the current fiscal year to date compared with the prior period.",
